# ATS AI Platform

This repository contains the initial scaffold for a modern ATS and recruiting intelligence platform.

## Included in this starter
- Monorepo structure
- Next.js frontend shell
- NestJS backend shell
- Shared types package
- PostgreSQL + Redis docker setup
- CI workflow for lint/test/build
- Architecture aligned with the recruitment scoring use case

## Next phases
1. Vacancy CRUD and scoring schema
2. CV upload and NLP extraction pipeline
3. Candidate ranking engine with explanations
4. Dashboard and advanced filters
5. Reports, audit logs, and compliance controls
